<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Payment Not Completed</title>
  <style>
    *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
    body{font-family:Segoe UI,Tahoma,Verdana,sans-serif;background:#f5f7fb;padding:18px;color:#132238}
    .wrap{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.08);overflow:hidden}
    .top{padding:22px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a237e,#283593);color:#fff}
    .top h1{font-size:28px;margin-bottom:6px}
    .top p{opacity:.95;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6}
    .content{padding:18px}
    .box{border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:18px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:14px}
    .title{font-size:20px;font-weight:1000;margin-bottom:10px;color:#0f172a}
    .muted{color:#64748b;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6}
    .support{background:#eff6ff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe}
    .btnRow{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px}
    .btn{display:inline-block;border-radius:14px;padding:13px 18px;font-weight:1000;text-decoration:none}
    .primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a237e,#3949ab);color:#fff}
    .ghost{background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#1e293b}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="top">
    <h1>Payment Not Completed ⚠️</h1>
    <p>Your payment could not be completed successfully.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="content">
    <div class="box">
      <div class="title">What to do next</div>
      <div class="muted">
        Please go to <b>Profile → Payments</b> to resume your payment.<br>
        If needed, you can also raise a complaint from the same Payments section.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="box support">
      <div class="title">Need Help?</div>
      <div class="muted">
        For any queries, please send <b>Hi</b> to <b>9493805059</b> on WhatsApp. We are ready to help you 24x7.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="btnRow">
      <a class="btn primary" href="/dashboard/profile?tab=payments">Go to Payments</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="/dashboard">Back to Dashboard</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>